# Tracked despite being a binary artifact: Railway/Render/Fly.io build the
# classifier container straight from this repo with no separate artifact
# storage set up, so the weights must actually be in git for a deploy to
# serve real predictions instead of silently falling back to the heuristic.
# ~9 MB — small enough that this is a reasonable tradeoff for this project.
!server/models/trash_classifier.pth
